<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT MEN'S CLAY COURT CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $289,250 U.S. Men's Clay Court Championships on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Martin Rodriguez (Argentina) beat 2-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>3-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Jeff Salzenstein (U.S.) 2-6 6-4 4-3 retired. Salzenstein suffered leg cramps.</p>
<p>5-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>8-Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Mariano Zabaleta (Argentina) 6-3 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Oliver Gross (Germany) beat Vincent Spadea (U.S.) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Dennis van Scheppingen (Netherlands)beat Patrik Fredriksson (Sweden) 6-4 6-4 Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) beat Roberto Jabali (Brazil) 4-6 6-2 6-3</p>
</text>
